    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring number 28 Cedar Avenue, Ridgewood to the open market for sale. This lovingly maintained 3 bed, 3 bath end of terrace home is tucked away within the highly sought-after Ridgewood development. Overlooking a pleasant green space, the property enjoys a west-facing rear garden and a B3 BER rating, making it an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, young families, or those looking to downsize.\n\nThe ground floor welcomes you with a bright and inviting entrance hallway, providing access to a spacious kitchen/diner, a welcoming lounge and a convenient guest WC. To the rear of the property, the kitchen/diner is filled with natural light, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen also benefits from direct access to the rear garden and is complemented by a spacious utility room, providing valuable additional storage and practical convenience. Located to the front of the property, the lounge offers a warm and inviting atmosphere, providing a cosy retreat to relax and unwind.\n\nUpstairs, the property boasts three well-proportioned bedrooms. The main bedroom is a spacious double featuring built-in wardrobes and a private en-suite. Bedroom two is another generous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, while bedroom three is ideally suited as a single bedroom, home office, or nursery. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nExternally, the west-facing rear garden has been designed with ease of maintenance in mind, featuring a tiered lawn area and patio area, providing a lovely outdoor space to relax and enjoy the afternoon and evening sun. To the front, the property is nicely set back from the road and benefits from communal on-street parking.\n\nLocated in the ever popular Ridgewood development the property is close to Tesco Express store, Pharmacy with Medical Centre and Crèche. Ridgewood is located within easy reach of Swords close to Forest Little Golf Club. Of particular noteworthiness within the development there is a Tesco Express store, Pharmacy with Medical Centre and Crèche. Swords village offers excellent recreational and leisure amenities including the Pavilions Shopping Centre, bars and restaurants and a bustling nightlife. Access to the City Centre is by way of a regular bus service, including the Swords Express, and the property is within easy reach of the M50.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.89m (9'6\") x 2m (6'7\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Guest WC\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.82m (6'0\") x 1.55m (5'1\")\n-With tiled floor\n-WC and WHB\n\n\nLounge - 5.15m (16'11\") x 4.18m (13'9\")\n-With laminate wood floor\n-Feature fireplace with marble hearth and timber surround\n\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.15m (16'11\") x 6.29m (20'8\")\n-With tiled floor\n-With a range of matching floor and eye level fitted press units\n-Integrated appliances\n-Tiled splashbacks\n-Doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.08m (6'10\") x 1.28m (4'2\")\n-With tiled floor\n-Plumbed for appliances\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3.34m (10'11\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\n-With carpet \n-Hot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.27m (10'9\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobes\n\nEn-Suite - 1.71m (5'7\") x 1.68m (5'6\")\n-Tiled floor & partially tiled walls\n-WC and WHB\n-Shower cubicle\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.82m (9'3\") x 2.94m (9'8\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.22m (7'3\") x 2.95m (9'8\")\n-With carpet \n-Built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.78m (5'10\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\n-Tiled floor & partially tiled walls\n-WC and WHB\n-Panel bath\n\n\n"
      },
